spans.s:
असक्त अ-सक्त, अस्, आ, अम्, detached, dis-
united; detached from worldly feelings or passions;
not interested in, unattached to, indifferent to.

असंश्रव अ-संश्रव, अस्, m. (rt. श्रु), the
being out of hearing; (ए), ind. out of the hearing of;
(अस्, आ, अम्), out of hearing, inaudible.

असम्मत अ-सम्मत, अस्, आ, अम् (rt. मन्),
disapproved, despised; dissentient, differing from;
averse, contrary.
—असम्मतादायिन् (˚त-आद्˚), ई,
इनी, इ, taking without the consent of the possessor;
a thief.

आश आश, अस्, आ, अम् (fr. rt. 2. अश्), an eater,
eating; often in this sense at the end of compounds;
(अस्), m. eating.

आ-सादित, अस्, आ, अम्, obtained, acquired, gained,
reached, gone to; spread, extended, overspread;
effected, completed; met with, attacked.
